WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.121
A sale from start to finish.

2
00:00:02.424 --> 00:00:04.605
You begin with “New needs analysis”:

3
00:00:04.978 --> 00:00:06.997
you record the client’s profile,

4
00:00:07.184 --> 00:00:10.027
their needs and their attitude to risk.

5
00:00:11.127 --> 00:00:12.392
Then a “New quotation”

6
00:00:12.392 --> 00:00:14.831
for each quote, and a “New comparison”

7
00:00:14.831 --> 00:00:15.886
for up to three.

8
00:00:16.259 --> 00:00:17.651
The “New proposal”

9
00:00:17.675 --> 00:00:19.532
goes out with your own branding,

10
00:00:19.556 --> 00:00:23.723
and when the client decides, you open a “New application”.

11
00:00:24.823 --> 00:00:27.585
Once the policy is issued, open “Sale files”.

12
00:00:27.888 --> 00:00:29.641
The list “Policies without a file”

13
00:00:29.641 --> 00:00:31.383
shows the active policies of the last

14
00:00:31.383 --> 00:00:33.065
twelve months that have no file;

15
00:00:33.368 --> 00:00:34.691
press “Open a file”.

16
00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:37.047
One file for each sale.

17
00:00:38.147 --> 00:00:39.621
You choose the kind of sale:

18
00:00:40.179 --> 00:00:43.394
life, with the KYC and AML file;

19
00:00:43.766 --> 00:00:45.542
general, with the IPID;

20
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:50.685
or an insurance-based investment product, which also needs a suitability assessment,

21
00:00:50.872 --> 00:00:53.948
a suitability statement, costs and the KID.

22
00:00:54.413 --> 00:00:56.375
You note whether advice was given,

23
00:00:56.375 --> 00:00:59.846
and whether the sale was face to face or at a distance.

24
00:01:00.946 --> 00:01:04.406
You write the client’s demands and needs in your own words and,

25
00:01:04.406 --> 00:01:07.400
if you gave advice, why the product best meets them.

26
00:01:07.703 --> 00:01:09.502
Then you date each disclosure:

27
00:01:09.804 --> 00:01:15.005
identity and register number, capacity, remuneration, complaints,

28
00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:19.022
data protection and the signed proposal, and link the document.

29
00:01:19.488 --> 00:01:22.877
The KYC item is filled in from the client’s tab.

30
00:01:23.977 --> 00:01:26.693
The file shows how complete it is and what is missing,

31
00:01:26.879 --> 00:01:28.504
and files are never deleted.

32
00:01:28.691 --> 00:01:31.837
It is an aid under the IDD and Cyprus Law thirty-eight

33
00:01:31.837 --> 00:01:34.889
of two thousand and sixteen, not legal advice;

34
00:01:35.354 --> 00:01:37.177
your insurer’s rules and the Insurance

35
00:01:37.177 --> 00:01:40.148
Companies Control Service’s guidance come first.

36
00:01:41.248 --> 00:01:43.431
Try it in “Sale files”, and read in “Help”

37
00:01:43.431 --> 00:01:45.160
what each kind of sale needs.
